    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Weighted graph</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Weighted union-find</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/evaluate-division/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 399</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Evaluate Division</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Each equation <code>a / b = k</code> is a pair of weighted edges <code>a -&gt; b (k)</code> and <code>b -&gt; a (1/k)</code>. A query is a path: multiply the weights along it. DFS/BFS per query works; weighted union-find answers each query in near O(1) by storing every variable's ratio to its group root.</p>\n"
  },
